al became a POM-only relocation stub pointing to org.hibernate.orm:hibernate-spatial, and the relocated module's Gradle metadata pulls in org.hibernate.orm:hibernate-platform with endorseStrictVersions=true, which declares constraints on both the old and new group:artifact simultaneously. Requesting the old coordinate directly (as the generated scaffold does, `testImplementation \\\"org.hibernate:hibernate-spatial:$libraryVersion\\\"`) collides with that platform constraint and fails with 'Component is the target of multiple version constraints with conflicting requirements' — reproduced locally with a scratch Gradle project. The fix is not an additional dependency: adding org.hibernate.orm:hibernate-spatial alongside the old coordinate still fails (verified). The generated build.gradle must use the new coordinate group instead.\",\n  \"deterministic_setup\": [],\n  \"agent_guidance\": \"In the generated build.gradle for org.hibernate:hibernate-spatial:8.0.0.Beta1, change the main test dependency from `testImplementation \\\"org.hibernate:hibernate-spatial:$libraryVersion\\\"` to `testImplementation \\\"org.hibernate.orm:hibernate-spatial:$libraryVersion\\\"`. Verified locally: the org.hibernate group id is a Maven POM relocation stub (packaging=pom, distributionManagement/relocation) for hibernate-orm 7.0.0.Final and later, including 8.0.0.Beta1; resolving it directly conflicts with the hibernate-platform BOM's endorsed strict version constraints, while depending on org.hibernate.orm:hibernate-spatial directly resolves cleanly (hibernate-core, geolatte-geom, jts-core, slf4j-api all pulled in without conflict). No other source changes are needed — the existing test (HibernateSpatialTest.java, using org.hibernate.boot.registry.StandardServiceRegistryBuilder and org.hibernate.spatial.integration.SpatialInitializer) compiles unchanged against 8.0.0.Beta1; both classes are still present in the 8.0.0.Beta1 jars under the same package names. No Docker image or system property is needed — the test only builds a StandardServiceRegistryBuilder, no live database.\",\n  \"risks\": [\"This same org.hibernate → org.hibernate.orm relocation affects every hibernate-spatial version from 7.0.0.Final onward, not just 8.0.0.Beta1, so any future version bump for this library will need the same coordinate fix.\"]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":7215,"type":"result","duration_ms":198427,"uuid":"3b631d2a-ed83-479e-947d-10e9156743d8","ttft_stream_ms":1252,"time_to_request_ms":69,"first_content_frame_ms":1252,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}

